Would you like to contribute to flawless mail delivery and are you looking for a flexible part-time job? Become a mail preparer at our client in Assen! In this role, you will be responsible for ensuring that mail is correctly sorted and prepared for dispatch.

As a mail preparer in Assen, you are responsible for accurately sorting incoming mail. You will check addresses and shipping details and use various mail processing machines to handle the mail efficiently. The job requires precision and good physical condition, as you will be working primarily on your feet. You should also be open to working overtime to assist your colleagues during backlogs or busy periods.

What we ask for:

- No minimum educational requirements;
- Precision and attention to detail;
- Enthusiastic and motivated attitude;
- You speak either Dutch or English;

Are you looking for a stable job with fixed working hours and a reliable employer? Do you enjoy physical work and working together with colleagues? Then we have a great opportunity for you!
FunctieomschrijvingFor our client, we are looking for motivated Order Pickers to join a modern logistics team. Experience is welcome, but if you are motivated and willing to learn, we would also like to meet you.
As an Order Picker, you play an important role in the warehouse. Every day you make sure customer orders are picked correctly and prepared for delivery. Accuracy is important because customers depend on receiving the right products.
Your daily tasks include:
- Picking orders using a handheld scanner;
- Checking products for quality and quantity;
- Packing and preparing orders for shipment;
- Making sure labels and orders are correct;
- Keeping your workplace clean, safe, and organised;
- Working together with your team to meet daily targets.

The work is active, so you'll be on your feet for most of the day. If you enjoy staying busy instead of sitting behind a desk, this job is a great fit.
Functie-eisenWe are looking for someone who:
- Speaks English, Polish and/or Dutch;
- Works accurately and pays attention to detail;
- Enjoys physical work;
- Can work independently as well as in a team;
- Is willing to work in a chilled warehouse environment;
- Is available to work Monday through Saturday. Working on Sundays and public holidays may also be part of the schedule;
- Has experience with order picking or a handheld scanner (preferred, but not required).

Arbeidsvoorwaarden- A starting salary of €2,600 gross per month (based on full-time employment);
- Shift allowance where applicable;
- Travel allowance;
- A good pension scheme;
- Stable working hours;
- A pleasant and international working environment;
- A reliable employer with long-term opportunities;
- The chance to develop yourself and grow within the company.

